                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN ZUR HERSTELLUNG VON RECYCELTEM ABS-HARZ</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ DE PRÉPARATION DE RÉSINE ABS RECYCLÉE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHOD FOR PREPARING RECYCLED ABS RESIN</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided is a method for preparing a recycled ABS resin, and the method for preparing a recycled ABS resin includes: preparing an extrusion feed including an acrylonitrile butadiene styrene (ABS) base resin including polyurethane, a metal carboxylic acid salt, and a polyhydric alcohol; and supplying the extrusion feed to an extruder to perform a depolymerization reaction of the polyurethane and extruding the extrusion feed.</p>
            </abstract>
